// the `repr` of its macro, the end of each conditional, the decisions
// about include guards, an include skipped as already seen, a rejected
// definition, whose macro Python's log reads back with KeyError, and a
// character that cp1252 can't encode, which raises UnicodeEncodeError.
// Each has a file name and runs with one of seven sets of flags. The
// rest are a selection of the corpus's sources.
